message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Maritime Supply Chain Disruption Index (MSDI): code, validation data, and results"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/md-muqtadir-fuad/msdi-maritime-disruption-index"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline for an LLM-derived, human-validated Maritime Supply
  Chain Disruption Index (MSDI), used to forecast Shanghai Containerized
  Freight Index (SCFI) movements, with time-series causality, double/debiased
  machine learning, multiplicity, and sensitivity analyses.
